","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Automotive","description":"Automotive","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:00+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#smartcoop-infomach-2024","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"smartcoop-infomach-2024","dateCreated":"2025-01-22T00:54:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-06T17:54:39+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eCom o apoio da AWS Partner Infomach, a Smartcoop, plataforma conectando cooperativas agropecu\u0026aacute;rias do Rio Grande do Sul, desenvolveu a Ana, uma assistente virtual baseada em AWS. Utilizando Amazon Bedrock, Ana facilita buscas precisas, economizando 20.000 horas anuais para produtores e cooperativas. A solu\u0026ccedil;\u0026atilde;o n\u0026atilde;o s\u0026oacute; aumentou a efici\u0026ecirc;ncia e a produtividade, como tamb\u0026eacute;m tem potencial para transformar o setor agropecu\u0026aacute;rio na regi\u0026atilde;o.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Smartcoop%20Logo%20200x70px.8f23207680e5c7ef1c9c5f708c2f7461f11d508d.png","footerInfoText":"2024","industry":"Agriculture","sortDate":"2024-10-02","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/partners/success/smartcoop-infomach/","publishedDate":"2024","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Assistente de IA 100% baseada em AWS cobre 706 mil hectares no RS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#portuguese","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Portuguese","description":"Portuguese","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#api-gateway","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon API Gateway","description":"Amazon API Gateway","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#brazil","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Brazil","description":"Brazil","dateCreated":"2020-04-20T18:05:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudwatch","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudWatch","description":"Amazon CloudWatch","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#agriculture","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Agriculture","description":"Agriculture","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:02:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:00+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#bedrock","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Bedrock","description":"Amazon Bedrock","dateCreated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#travelex-integration-on-aws","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"travelex-integration-on-aws","dateCreated":"2024-11-01T16:08:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-11-01T16:33:52+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Travelex started a digital transformation initiative to simplify and modernize its technology infrastructure. Travelex had built an extensive network of technology systems and used five separate extract, transform, load (ETL) solutions to integrate those systems, and faced challenges such as tight coupling, high licensing costs, and scalability issues. To build its modern solution, Travelex used Integration on AWS — a broad suite of purpose-built application, file, and data integration services provided by AWS. Travelex was now able to seamlessly connect its source applications, such as point-of-sale systems for its physical locations, to its destination applications—including Travelex compliance, fraud, finance, and marketing systems and partner software-as-a-service (SaaS) solutions. As a result of using Integration on AWS services including AWS Lambda and Amazon API Gateway, Travelex was now able to reduce 70% in integration costs, 90% in operational costs, 40% in infrastructure overhead, and save £395,000 in third-party license fees.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Travelex_Logo.86ceb559b73a36cf3addff36d29e3283df01d37e.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Travelex_Logo.86ceb559b73a36cf3addff36d29e3283df01d37e.png","displayLocation":"Americas","customerNameLower":"travelex","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2024-10-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/travelex-integration-on-aws/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Travelex","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Travelex Reduces Integration Costs by 70% Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#app-integration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Application Integration","description":"Application Integration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#well-architected-tool","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Well-Architected Tool","description":"AWS Well-Architected Tool","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_