 research, the emerging company, One BioSciences, has taken genetic sequencing to a new level. The company has developed a protocol able to analyse individual cells and the way in which they communicate with each other. It\u0027s a highly accurate process that could lead to new cancer treatments, but it also generates huge volumes of data. That\u0027s why One Biosciences has chosen to use Amazon Web Services (AWS) solutions to drive its research.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/one-biosciences-logo%401x.acc115d57f98298fb90d00a848c93c79fa385a19.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"one biosciences","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2024-07-08","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/one-biosciences?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"One Biosciences","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Thanks to AWS, One BioSciences is revolutionising single-cell sequencing and waging war on cancer","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#microsoft-exchange","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Microsoft Exchange","description":"Microsoft Exchange","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3"