ed to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#datafarming-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"datafarming-case-study","dateCreated":"2022-07-16T00:00:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-07-16T00:01:55+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"DataFarming, a precision agriculture company based in Australia, reached 40 percent of the Australian grains market in 4 years using Amazon ECS in its digital solution, which delivers data quickly and cost effectively to farmers.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/datafarming-logo%401x.8ca86b8ee188f0135b8b39aaea72dad95f85e186.png","displayLocation":"Australia","customerNameLower":"datafarming","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Aerospace","sortDate":"2022-07-15","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/datafarming-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"DataFarming","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"DataFarming Processes Data from 35 Million Acres Using Amazon ECS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#australia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespa