S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#translate","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Translate","description":"Amazon Translate","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#private-5g","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Private 5G","description":"AWS Private 5G","dateCreated":"2021-12-16T04:57:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:55+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#vertex06302022sgoisngoioin","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"vertex06302022sgoisngoioin","dateCreated":"2023-02-08T01:17:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:24+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"In this episode of This is My Architecture, learn how Vertex Pharmaceuticals built a highly elastic, cost effective small molecule search platform using Serverless technologies. They democratized access to this system by making it available as an API using Amazon API Gateway, and the entire system comes alive in response to a request using AWS Lambda, AWS Fargate, and other technologies. To keep the system cost effective, Vertex made use of Fargate Spot for the search workers.\nLearn more about Vertex and explore career opportunities at vrtx.com","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Vertex_Logo%401x.409b3b5522c7002f8ba51cf9df3d35ead2cb7356.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"vertex pharmaceuticals incorporated","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Life Sciences","sortDate":"2022-06-30","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/nflGdpwbf54?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Vertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Vertex Pharmaceuticals: A Serverless Platform for Small Molecule Search","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#mq","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon MQ","description":"Amazon MQ","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:51+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","description":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"20