ot Fleet to transcode the data. To be cost effective, they also use a Lambda function that leverage CloudWatch metrics that uses target tracking to scale in or out, helping them reduce compute costs by 28%.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Hudl_Customer-Reference_Logo.79eafd15591be015c0bd847dba63dddbc4743142.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"hudl/agile sports","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2022-06-27","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/KgRib8AM0fs?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Hudl/Agile Sports","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Hudl: Ingesting and Transcoding Video Data Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#media-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Media Services","description":"Media Services","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:12+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudwatch","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudWatch","description":"Amazon CloudWatch","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sqs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","description":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-