tiCache for Redis","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:16:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:34+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#nexthink06012022lknsdflk","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"nexthink06012022lknsdflk","dateCreated":"2023-02-08T01:17:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-02-08T01:38:40+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Nexthink Experience is a SaaS solution combining real-time analytics, automation and employee feedback across all endpoints to help IT teams delight people at work. Nexthink\u0027s cloud-native platform is deployed in multiple regions using a scalable platform on top of AWS infrastructure. Learn how Nexthink APIs leverage Amazon API Gateway, AWS Lambda, Amazon DynamoDB and AWS Transit Gateway to reduce cost and latency and improve customer experience.","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"nexthink s.a.","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":