iptionSummary":"Homegate has decided to re-architect its monolithic real estate platform towards microservices leveraging serverless services on AWS. Apart from AWS Lambdas, they are using other managed services whenever possible to increase speed, productivity and reduce operational overhead. This episode walks through how Homegate has built a new property listing ingestion mechanism while integrating it with the monolith for the sake of stepwise the rollout process.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/homegate-ch-logo%401x.627bc68c5ab8507504579e42c22b9f75128d18e8.png","displayLocation":"Switzerland","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2022-03-22","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/eEfWd4EgH_s?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Homegate AG: A Serverless Real Estate Platform","customer-name":"Homegate AG"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","date