lds":{"descriptionSummary":"Teva Respiratory, LLC (Teva), an affiliate of Teva Pharmaceutical Industries Ltd., a major worldwide pharmaceutical company, saw an opportunity to use digital device technology to provide objective inhaler data to patients and caregivers, helping to support a more informed dialogue between healthcare providers and patients in the management of their respiratory conditions. Teva used a group of Amazon Web Services (AWS) services—including AWS Lambda and Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3)—and worked alongside AWS Premier Consulting Partner Onica, a Rackspace Technology company, to construct its serverless architecture for the Digihaler® family of inhalers.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/teva_Logo%401x.91b79b7ff10d29d26d7a3e4708f54b05fe32992c.png","displayLocation":"Israel","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Life Sciences","sortDate":"2022-01-07","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/teva/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","customer-name":"Teva","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Teva Uses AWS to Manage Digital Inhaler Data for Patients and Healthcare Providers"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#high-performance-computing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"High Performance Computing","description":"High Performance Computing","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-26T01:35:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east-africa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","description":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T