,"description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#devops","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"DevOps","description":"DevOps","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#gobierno-ciudad-buenos-aires","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"gobierno-ciudad-buenos-aires","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:04:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:38+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"El Gobierno de la Ciudad de Buenos Aires es uno de los más importantes de Argentina. Uno de sus principales intereses es poner a los ciudadanos en el centro de las diversas decisiones políticas. Para ello resulta importante tener consolidada la información que el GCABA genera y recolecta para llevar adelante la operación que está en cabeza de las diferentes dependencias con el fin de posibilitar un re-diseño más efectivo de las políticas públicas en base a datos. Dichos datos están siendo consolidados en PIBA (Plataforma Inteligente de Buenos Aires), desarrollada en la nube de AWS.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/buenosairesciudad%401x.7b6f1445a271ceb344bc9983d823cb601cec37b2.png","displayLocation":"Argentina","customerNameLower":"ar - buenos aires government (gcba) / same","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"State and Local Government","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/gobierno-ciudad-buenos-aires/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"AR - Buenos Aires Government (GCBA) / SAME","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"AWS ayuda a reducir la burocracia y acelerar la transformación digital en Buenos Aires"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#api-gateway","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon API Gateway","description":"Amazon API Gateway","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Amazon Redshift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#glue","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Glue","description":"AWS Glue","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#govt-state-local","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"State and Local Governme