I Gateway","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache","description":"Amazon ElastiCache","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:13:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ses","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Email Service (SES)","description":"Amazon Simple Email Service (SES)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:00+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#app-integration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Application Integration","description":"Application Integration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#iam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Identity and Access Management","description":"AWS Identity and Access Management","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:41+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#elmarques","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"elmarques","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:04:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:42+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"El Marqués es un importante municipio del estado de Querétaro, en México. Se caracteriza por las inversiones nacionales y transnacionales que recibe, tanto el sector industrial como comercial. Además de ser líder mundial en el sector aeronáutico y aeroespacial, tiene un desarrollo exponencial en proyectos habitacionales, centros comerciales, fábricas y bodegas logísticas. El trabajo en conjunto con AWS se encaminó hacia la mejora de los servicios digitales para la ciudadanía, lo cual redundó en mayor recaudación para el municipio y en más eficiencia para los procesos de cobro.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/elmarques%402x.4bbc069bd4eec158558cc0840c72a2726ff4d4f6.png","displayLocation":"México","customerNameLower":"el marqués","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios públicos generales","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/elmarques/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"El Marqués","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"El Marqués digitaliza servicios para beneficio de la población, con AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#route53","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Route 53","description":"Amazon Route 53","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#mexico","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBA