der mundial en el sector aeronáutico y aeroespacial, tiene un desarrollo exponencial en proyectos habitacionales, centros comerciales, fábricas y bodegas logísticas. El trabajo en conjunto con AWS se encaminó hacia la mejora de los servicios digitales para la ciudadanía, lo cual redundó en mayor recaudación para el municipio y en más eficiencia para los procesos de cobro.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/industry-images-customer-references/Hacienda_Atongo_Oct_24_JVQ_1-1200x800.108d7f01526216833072fdc1833f440e15087e8e.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/elmarques%402x.4bbc069bd4eec158558cc0840c72a2726ff4d4f6.png","displayLocation":"México","customerNameLower":"él marques","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios públicos generales","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/elmarques/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Él Marques","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"El Marqués digitaliza servicios para beneficio de la población, con AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#connect","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Connect","description":"Amazon Connect","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:26+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Public Sector","description":"Public Sector","dateCreated":"2019-09-23T21:02:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated"