e Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#elite-cloud-front","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"elite-cloud-front","dateCreated":"2021-10-27T02:41:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:51+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Italian cycling company Elite developed an e-training program using a suite of AWS services that scale with ease, optimize savings, drive innovation, and improve the online experience for users.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/elite-logo%401x.c1e4e24d756f21aff58fe25d9d32ca7449335e66.png","displayLocation":"Italy","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG)","sortDate":"2021-10-26","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/elite-cloud-front/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","customer-name":"Elite","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Elite Delivers Video Races to Cyclists Worldwide Using Amazon CloudFront"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#italy","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Italy","description":"Italy","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"