+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:48+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Working in collaboration with Amazon Web Services (AWS), HSBC\u0027s Wealth \u0026 Personal Banking business shares how it is able to innovate faster and provide easier and more secure digital banking to meet their customer\u0027s changing needs. Using AWS serverless technology, HSBC\u0027s message orchestration platform is able to ingest and analyze both internal and external data, providing a personalized digital messaging service to meet customer needs.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/HSBC_Logo%401x.0b3e2bfb1f531f98ff95cec12652d1bc7b35e285.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2021-06-04","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/hsbc-wealth-and-personal-banking/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"HSBC","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"HSBC’s Wealth \u0026 Personal Banking Innovates Digital Messaging Strategy Using Serverless on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis","description":"Amazon Kinesis","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#datacenter-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Datacenter Migration","description":"Datacenter Migration","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T04:21:23+0000"},{