vator","description":"Innovator","dateCreated":"2022-04-05T21:17:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:35+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#cinnafilm3049dogjwlo","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"cinnafilm3049dogjwlo","dateCreated":"2022-05-23T21:41:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-23T21:52:23+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Alfred She from Cinnafilm, Inc. explains how the company uses native AWS services to implement PixelStrings, a flexible and scalable platform for video and audio processing. PixelStrings offers transcoding, high-quality motion-based frame rate conversion, audio and video retiming, deinterlacing, denoising, and re-texturing. Learn how Amazon EC2 (general compute and GPU instances), Amazon S3, and AWS Lambda work together in the PixelStrings video/audio processing PaaS (Platform as a Service). PixelStrings provides a full-stack web application and a JSON-RPC API that customers use to upload, process, and download video and audio assets.","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2020-02-25","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/BZ32w0SSAoY?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"PixelStrings by Cinnafilm: A Flexible \u0026 Scalable Platform for Video/Audio Optimization \u0026 Conversion","customer-name":"Cinnafilm, Inc."}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#reference-arch-diagram","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Reference Architecture Di