rn how Amazon SQS, Amazon SNS, Amazon SES, and AWS Lambda can be leveraged to notify your customers of alerts in real time. By leveraging these elastic services, you can handle any number of notifications in your system, from 10s to millions, with the same workflow, only paying for what you use and having automated scaling.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/mueller-water_Logo%401x.7eeff2adb4944900efd630d02483a05ca659f123.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Manufacturing","sortDate":"2020-01-17","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/MbkLJ62jtMc?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","customer-name":"Mueller Water Products, Inc.","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Mueller Water Products: Scalable Ingestion of Sensor Data for Municipal Water Conservation (LIVE)"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sqs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","description":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#enviro-protection","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Environmental Protection","description":"Environmental Protection","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:06:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"202