ology like serverless on AWS, Accolade connects personal health data, employer programs, and wellness tools to provide personalized health and benefits solutions for employees. Accolade moved toward a serverless approach centered on Amazon API Gateway, AWS Lambda, AWS Lambda@Edge, and Amazon CloudFront to complement their use of containers. Minhui Burket, Senior Software Engineer at Accolade, explains how AWS has enabled Accolade to modernize its services, reduce cost, and improve security.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/accolade-logo%401x.881a7b6662af995a0d638d501d78a4d460cba529.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2020-01-14","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/Jz2RPRhF6Fs?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","customer-name":"Accolade, Inc","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Accolade: Security and Operational Excellence in Healthcare (LIVE)"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","n