dated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#innovator#innovator-hub","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#innovator","name":"Item in Innovator Hub","description":"\u003cp\u003eItems with this tag are being displayed in an Innovator-specific prefiltered Directory.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#anatoscope","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"anatoscope","dateCreated":"2024-08-15T21:35:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-08-15T21:43:39+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Créée en 2015, Anatoscope développe des solutions logicielles permettant de créer des avatars 3D à partir d’images médicales de patients. Grâce à ce jumeau numérique, les appareillages ou prothèses en dentaire et orthopédie peuvent être testés virtuellement avant d’être appliqués au patient. Startup de la health tech, Anatoscope est issue de la recherche académique française (CNRS Montpellier ainsi qu’INRIA et CHU de Grenoble).","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/anatoscope-logo%401x.aeef95220a532351d14f7ec5b9dd1cc875a5bbf2.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"anatoscope","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/anatoscope/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Anatoscope","publishedDate":"2020","enableShare":"1","headline":"Etude de cas AWS : Anatoscope","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#conten