\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","customer-name":"Genoplan","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Genoplan establishes a foundation for Asia\u0027s leading genetic testing service on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#hcls","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Healthcare \u0026 Life Sciences","description":"Healthcare \u0026 Life Sciences","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-14T20:13:37+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market","description":"Mid-Market","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#life-sciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Life Sciences","description":"Life Sciences","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#healthcare","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Healthcare","description":"Healthcare","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#concert-properties","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"concert-properties","dateCreated":"2020-01-23T21:22:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:48+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Canadian real estate company Concert Properties used AWS to create a custom data hub with a microservices architecture to integrate previously siloed data from across its diversified operations.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Concert3D_Logo_@1x.9accab1934f7ce39edd92621f89f7b35a236c7cb.png","displayLocation":"Canada","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Construction \u0026 Real Estate","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/concert-properties-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Concert Properties","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Concert Properties Achieves Near-Real-Time Data Integration and Reporting on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"G