onenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#yieldmo-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"yieldmo-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T15:19:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:38+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Using Amazon Kinesis, Yieldmo analyzes online ad-interaction data in milliseconds, gains real-time insights, and optimizes ad placements to deliver more efficient ad campaigns for mobile advertisers. Yieldmo provides advertising technologies that help publishers monetize digital content.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/600x400_Yieldmo_Logo.c5a04d6fb86aee87795cdc882a07eb0ef10ad6af.jpg","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the Yieldmo customer case study, powered by the AWS Cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/yieldmo/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Yieldmo","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Cust