 on the AWS Cloud while halving the cost of its digital and technology stack. Haymarket Media—a leading media specialist company—publishes titles such as AsianInvestor, Campaign, FinanceAsia, Corporate Treasurer, FourFourTwo, Stuff, and Autocar in Asia, and manages live events across the region.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/HaymarketMediaLimited_Customer-Reference_Logo.39bde222d04730e61eba4610e67f28a40ed4ecf2.png","displayLocation":"Hong Kong","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the Haymarket Media Limited customer case study, powered by the AWS Cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/haymarket-media/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Haymarket Media Limited","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Haymarket Media Limited"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Amazon Redshift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","