S","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"festo-generative-ai","dateCreated":"2024-06-12T18:23:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-06-13T17:20:23+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"With a mission to make the working world simpler and more sustainable, industrial automation leader Festo is always looking to harness new technologies. So generative artificial intelligence (AI) and Amazon Web Services (AWS) are already part of everyday life, says Alfred Hagmeyer the company’s head of technical support. The Germany-based firm, which provides automation solutions and components for manufacturing and other industries, is delivering faster, smarter services to hundreds of thousands of customers across the world using AWS.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Festo_logo%401x.888573ea13d00b2347102050aef280e8c3db8b7b.png","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Festo_logo%401x.888573ea13d00b2347102050aef280e8c3db8b7b.png","displayLocation":"Europe","customerNameLower":"festo","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Manufacturing","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/festo-generative-ai/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Festo","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","headline":"Festo Drives Innovation in Automation Using Generative AI and AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#manufacturing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Manufacturing","description":"Manufacturing","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-ref